cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Kosha in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Kosha: open-source product lifecycle management (PLM)"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Kosha contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kishor-desarda/Kosha"
url: "https://github.com/kishor-desarda/Kosha"
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
version: "0.5.0.dev0"
abstract: >-
  Kosha is a free, open-source, self-hosted product lifecycle management (PLM) and product data
  management (PDM) system for engineering companies: revision control for CAD files and drawings,
  engineering bills of materials, engineering change orders and ERP synchronisation.
keywords:
  - PLM
  - product lifecycle management
  - PDM
  - product data management
  - bill of materials
  - engineering change order
  - CAD
  - revision control
  - ERP integration
